# Generated by scripts/generate_kicad_dru.py from TEMPER_NET_CLASSES --
# never hand-edited, never tracked. scripts/ci_check_drc.py regenerates it
# fresh before every kicad-cli-backend DRC run (CI and local alike) so the
# gate never measures against a stale or missing rules file. See
# docs/evidence/2026-07-27-drc-truth-gate-discrepancy.md.
/pcb/*.kicad_dru

# Simulations
*.raw
/*.log
/*.txt
!/.loc-allowlist.txt
# Generated from uv.lock and COPYed by .github/docker/ci.Dockerfile to
# pre-install third-party Python deps into the image's /_temper-venv. It must be
# tracked or the image build fails on a missing COPY source; the blanket /*.txt
# rule above would otherwise silently exclude it from `git add`.
!/requirements-ci.txt

